<title>BELGIUM: BRUSSELS BOURSE SUSPENDS LA HERSEAUTOISE.</title>
<headline>BRUSSELS BOURSE SUSPENDS LA HERSEAUTOISE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brussels Stock Exchange said on Tuesday it had suspended trade in textile company La Herseautoise until further notice.</p>
<p>The bourse said it took the move because of a legal challenge against the company at Tournai Commercial Court which relates to payments.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
